{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n各位米線狂熱粉注意！香港人對米線嘅熱愛程度簡直瘋狂，新假期今次為大家推介全港8間必食米線小店，多間都是米線關注組的熱捧名店！不論你鍾意極致重口味、古法酸辣、濃郁沙嗲湯抑或驚艷炸物，總有一間啱你心水！\n</p>\n<h2>全港8間必食米線小店推介！</h2>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_18313940886af3e0a7a7607-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"米線 （圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_18313940886af3e0a7a7607-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_7404533806af3e4e2661a8-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"米線 （圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wwig_sakura_new-_7404533806af3e4e2661a8-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>1.金西南米線</h2>\n<p>金西南米線是旺角、銅鑼灣人氣米線店，亦是多年來米線關注組熱捧的名店。必試自家秘製酸辣湯底 ，以多種香料熬製，內有秘製辣肉碎、韭菜、酸菜等配菜，酸香有層次，辣度順喉，十分開胃。米線方面，咬下去的口感彈牙且有煙韌感，掛湯能力相當不錯，每一口都能品嚐到湯底酸辣滋味。此外，金西南米線還提供超過30款配料，當中最出色的配料是金獎腩肉，經長時間炆煮，軟腍入味，油香濃郁而不膩，其他人氣配料仲有牛肝菌(限量)、滷水豬肚、豬大腸等。金西南米線還有多道冷盤小食，如麻辣手撕雞、手拍青瓜、藤椒魚皮等；另外炸物也有香口的皮蛋炸豆卜、雞軟骨等供顧客選擇。但最估不到竟然仲有甜品供應，人氣必點金黃香脆鴛鴦炸饅頭、以及爆漿紅糖糍粑，一次過滿足一眾米線甜品控！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cc24-09-03-0681_15837844266af2b976548ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cc24-09-03-0681_15837844266af2b976548ca-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n金獎腩肉酸辣小鍋米線（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cc24-09-03-0612_18333514146af2b9783a621.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cc24-09-03-0612_18333514146af2b9783a621-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n麻辣手撕雞（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cc24-09-03-0686_13344529066af2cbb9aa888.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cc24-09-03-0686_13344529066af2cbb9aa888-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n腩肉（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_16100420446af2e7da56b87.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"636\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_16100420446af2e7da56b87-1024x678.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n藤椒魚皮（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc057975_8208954146af2b97a1d46a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc057975_8208954146af2b97a1d46a-1024x1536.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n皮蛋炸豆卜（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc057353_3564431716af2e7d7c9246.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc057353_3564431716af2e7d7c9246-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n鴛鴦炸饅頭（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc06074_10286367666af2cbbba3e71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc06074_10286367666af2cbbba3e71-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc05958_20756795456af2b97d5ba28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1577\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/dsc05958_20756795456af2b97d5ba28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>金西南米線</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍旺角花園街3-5號鴻威大廈2座地下9號舖</p>\n<p>📍銅鑼灣登龍街41-51號金龍大廈地下D號舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kamsainam.noodle/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>2.川品雲南米線</h2>\n<p>無論是米線關注組抑或是Threads友都力推的米線小店，店主曾遠赴雲南跟師傅學藝，每一碗米線都用明火逐碗炮製。招牌酸麻辣湯底鹹中帶有微酸，濃郁惹味，配合滑溜微彈的粗身米線，掛湯力一流！店家最出名是招牌生炸豬頸肉，炸到外皮金黃微脆，肉質juicy，絕對係每檯必點嘅名物！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/480597092_9222190284560780_6104308690514439957_n_8270682226af3df0f8529b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/480597092_9222190284560780_6104308690514439957_n_8270682226af3df0f8529b-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/482221213_3936998239950040_6119304575752979757_n_13852749806af3df12a7134.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"998\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/482221213_3936998239950040_6119304575752979757_n_13852749806af3df12a7134-1024x1065.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/473727412_1105823667907825_477506438021617626_n_18310932276af3df0d1e468.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/473727412_1105823667907825_477506438021617626_n_18310932276af3df0d1e468-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>川品雲南米線</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍大角咀大角咀道38號新九龍廣場地下023-026號舖</p>\n<p>📍北角電氣道233號城市花園地下G53號舖</p>\n<p>📍荃灣荃華街16號荃薈地下A101B號舖</p>\n<p>📍新蒲崗康強街17A號地舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/klne12/?locale=zh_HK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方FB</a></p>\n<h2>3.龍川雲南米線</h2>\n<p>呢間最初隱藏喺太子塘尾道嘅街坊小店，憑住高質湯底及配料，喺關注組一炮而紅，更先後在元朗及灣仔開分店。店家最出名是獨門調配酸麻辣湯底，湯頭酸度與麻味嘅比例恰到好處，先品嚐到醇厚的湯頭及微酸，隨之而來有強烈辛辣後勁，麻香又辣。而近期店主更專程到泰國學師，推出全新泰式冬蔭功湯底，做到非常貼近泰國當地街頭風味，酸辣開胃，香氣十足，配埋幼身煙韌又掛湯嘅米線，簡直絕配！必食小食大推招牌炸䱽魚、豬頸肉、孜然魷魚鬚、墨魚春卷，選擇超豐富！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-10-27-at-13.59.20-1_12646486706af2c33bf1f71.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-10-27-at-13.59.20-1_12646486706af2c33bf1f71-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n泰式冬蔭墨魚春卷白魚蛋米線（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-10-27-at-13.59.21_1601265246af2c343d03f5.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-10-27-at-13.59.21_1601265246af2c343d03f5-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n孜然魷魚鬚（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-10-27-at-13.59.20_11872504816af2c33f1ebf9.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-image-2026-10-27-at-13.59.20_11872504816af2c33f1ebf9-1024x1365.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>龍川雲南米線</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍太子塘尾道186號地下</p>\n<p>📍元朗鳳攸南街9號好順利大廈地下14號舖</p>\n<p>📍灣仔軒尼詩道153號地下</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dragonriver22/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方IG</a></p>\n<h2>4.唯一雲貴川風味</h2>\n<p>荃灣區30年老字號人氣米線店，深受街坊熟客推介。店家主打酸辣雲南米線，湯底混合川貴辣風味，以大量辣椒熬成，偏重口味，辣度循序漸進，味道醇厚而極有深度。配料方面最多人推介香滷腩肉，肥瘦比例剛好，滷得極之入味；秘製炸醬鹹香惹味，師傅畀得毫不手軟，簡直係爆量！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/513089601_10238999385628173_6264252224481487026_n_10210202386af3e022c57f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1706\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/513089601_10238999385628173_6264252224481487026_n_10210202386af3e022c57f5-1024x1820.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/165280290_10158995623695309_4456132109827142750_n_1255211106af3e020784ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1286\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/165280290_10158995623695309_4456132109827142750_n_1255211106af3e020784ac-1024x1372.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_1___15768696926af3e024b2e2c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_1___15768696926af3e024b2e2c-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>唯一雲貴川風味</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍荃灣四陂坊14號地舖</p>\n<h2>5.新貴香園</h2>\n<p>新貴香園是荃灣最強米線店之一，每逢食飯時間都排長龍。而店家最出名是特濃沙嗲湯底，色澤微黃濃郁，有滿滿花生碎粒，入口鹹香帶甜，質感稠密好掛湯；另外供應雲南酸辣、酸麻辣等惹味湯底。炸物都好出色，大推炸豬頸肉、炸豬扒、炸茄子，記得要留個肚試齊佢！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/506055343_4359625597696606_406651100528912905_n_286415216af3e2028566f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/506055343_4359625597696606_406651100528912905_n_286415216af3e2028566f-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/505989868_10161711503661302_6983464123910067095_n_2115770226af3e2008acc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/505989868_10161711503661302_6983464123910067095_n_2115770226af3e2008acc7-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-10-5.04.44_5450728336af3e204b1fbc.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"805\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-10-5.04.44_5450728336af3e204b1fbc.png\" width=\"657\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>新貴香園</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍荃灣西樓角路202-216號昌安大廈荃昌中心1樓53-54號舖</p>\n<p>📍荃灣享和街51號都城大樓地下E號舖</p>\n<h2>6.雲川米線．紅薯粉</h2>\n<p>講到新界西嘅米線霸主，一定有雲川米線．紅薯粉這個名字！呢間由屯門發迹嘅人氣神店，近年更將版圖擴展至元朗、天水圍，甚至進軍觀塘！雲川共有5款特色湯底，有用大量鮮魚每日熬煮的招牌鮮魚湯底、酸麻金湯底、酸辣湯等，記得跟配鎮店之寶炭燒豬頸肉，外皮微焦脆，肉質嫩滑！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/717418992_122167769030703009_162423936761601247_n_571309246af3e2659473b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/717418992_122167769030703009_162423936761601247_n_571309246af3e2659473b-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/img_0898_9327734606af3e225bf5bd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1616\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/img_0898_9327734606af3e225bf5bd-1024x1724.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：（圖片來源：新假期編輯部））\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/img_6138_18721046016af3e2289089b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/img_6138_18721046016af3e2289089b-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>雲川米線．紅薯粉</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/764925300_1587183056446670_1796817102550396582_n_12408697256af3e31fb890a-1024x450.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"米線 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"422\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/764925300_1587183056446670_1796817102550396582_n_12408697256af3e31fb890a-1024x450.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/p/%E9%9B%B2%E5%B7%9D-100054649710414/?locale=zh_HK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方FB</a></p>\n<h2>7.天星雲南米線</h2>\n<p>天星雲南米線是米線關注組熱捧店，無論任何時間都大排長龍。當中最推介是酸麻辣湯底，集酸爽及麻辣於一身，配上腩肉、豬軟骨、鴨血等配料，索汁惹味。而配料方面，有超過30款選擇，其中就以香脆煎䱽魚、酥香豬頸肉、煙韌滑嫩鴨血、軟嫩豬軟骨最受歡迎，幾乎每枱必點。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/184773365_198795165411045_4160493639749840960_n_10825985306af3e373af1c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1419\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/184773365_198795165411045_4160493639749840960_n_10825985306af3e373af1c9-1024x1514.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/127044020_103019314988631_344989699775386911_n_15401474076af3e3772f12f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/127044020_103019314988631_344989699775386911_n_15401474076af3e3772f12f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/126973350_103018938322002_8689189119475634840_n_2905336056af3e37892a9f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/126973350_103018938322002_8689189119475634840_n_2905336056af3e37892a9f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>天星雲南米線</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍旺角砵蘭街136號地舖</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063877341376&amp;locale=zh_HK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">官方FB</a></p>\n<h2>8.富金軒雲南米線</h2>\n<p>富金軒雲南米線（平記富金軒雲南米線）最初是佐敦官涌街市熟食中心的人氣小店，憑着馳名黃酒雞米線打響名堂，後來更搬入佐敦地舖重開，大大改善環境衛生。店家的黃酒雞湯米線以40斤豬骨、雞殼等熬足一日，再加入多種藥材包括紅棗、薑、杞子和黃酒用鐵鑊炒製，湯頭鮮甜暖胃，帶酒香味，啖啖回甘。</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/176224321998882623_4912199246909b2950a7a9_11621999666af3e411c3fe0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1079\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/176224321998882623_4912199246909b2950a7a9_11621999666af3e411c3fe0-1024x1151.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：香港米線關注組)）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/batch_img_4150_9559890796385db2a3f41b-1024x768_170006150863bd46de538a6_21242909096af3e3e4aa035.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/batch_img_4150_9559890796385db2a3f41b-1024x768_170006150863bd46de538a6_21242909096af3e3e4aa035-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：新假期編輯部）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/176224322027741156_5447889556909b2953b0de_10742738906af3e3e6d616b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/176224322027741156_5447889556909b2953b0de_10742738906af3e3e6d616b-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>富金軒雲南米線</p>\n<p>門市地址：</p>\n<p>📍佐敦廟街259A號地下E號舖</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:12:03.515665+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2561,"images":32,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:47:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:16.877462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:05:36.781789+00:00","content_hash":"bce0c322200d2fd3474a38bd205578b3c75021bdbfa6f7fbf2d85817477814fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}